WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.840
Kinkirisiw, minw ye kungo kɔnɔ lɔnnikɛlaw ye.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.656
Nka, mɔgɔkɔrɔbaw b'a fɔ ko n'i bɔra dugu kɔnɔ sɔgɔma joona, i t'a sɔrɔ i kelen lo kungo kɔnɔ.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.184
Tuma dɔw la, kinkirsiw be yɛlɛn kongosogow kan.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.792
U b'a weele ko kinkirga.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.674
Lɔnnikɛla Doris Bonnet y'a fɔ ko hakili senu mɔgɔw labɛnna jɛnkulu dɔw kɔnɔ. U kelen kelen bɛɛ tɔgɔ bɔra u ka mɔgɔ kɔrɔw lo la.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.888
Fɛn minw ka di o ye, o ye li ye, ani jeseji, ani ŋɔmi, ani yiridenw.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.752
U b'a fɔ fana ko denmisɛnw lo be na, sanko deen fila.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.320
U dɔw b'a fɛ ka kuma n'u ye.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.890
O vɛrise kɔnɔ, u ye min fɔ o koo la, a y'o lajɛ. A ma Kaya ka maana dɔ fɔ fɔlɔ.
